      "body": "GTN Industries Limited announced private placement to issue 2,459,622 equity shares at an issue price of INR 24 for gross proceeds of INR 59,030,928 on June 5, 2026. The transaction includes participation from Rakesh Kalapala  for 600,000 shares, Atluri Raja Babu for 600,000 shares, Kollu Anantha Srinivasa Rao for 400,000 shares, Manepalli V Gana Suresh  for 300,000 shares, Nandigam Abhishek  for 259,622 shares, Mohit Gurjar for 2,00,000 shares, Ramarao Talluri for 1,00,000 shares. The transaction is approved by board of directors of the company and is subject to approval of board of directors of the company in its Extra Ordinary General Meeting of the members to be held on July 6, 2026. The company will issue equity shares on preferential basis.",
